# Hearthome City (the original's CITY05 role): the city of warm hearts, with its Contest Hall, the church-like
# foreign building, Amity Square where people stroll with their Pokémon, and the Pokémon Fan Club. A warm,
# lilting E-flat swing: a violin sings the tune over swung piano, a soft church organ, a walking bass and brushed
# drums, a trumpet takes the bridge and bells peal at the ends of phrases; at night a clarinet, a horn, a pad
# and an electric piano. Original composition for this game.
title Hearthome City
tempo 120
meter 4/4
reverb 0.3
nighttempo 0.92

